# boot-timing overlay notes. NO BASE_SHA256 here, deliberately: unlike
# patches/ple-ct-ignore (a whole-file overlay, valid only over one exact
# upstream file), this patch NEVER replaces an upstream file. It injects
# sitecustomize.py via PYTHONPATH and wraps upstream functions post-import,
# looked up by name at import time. If upstream renames/removes a target the
# hook no-ops and the report prints "hooks NOT applied: <list>" -- the boot
# itself is untouched either way. So nothing to re-derive on snapshot bumps;
# only a shrinking report would ever signal drift.
#
# Verified against: image iphands/vllm-blackwell:cu1321-sm120-main-vllm0.31.0.
#   dev20260924-g36f94d5 (VLLM_MAIN_SHA 36f94d5, V2 Model Runner), 2026-09-25,
#   by grepping each target in the shipped tree, then by the smoke test below.
#
# Hook table (module -> attr; all confirmed present in that image):
#   vllm.entrypoints.launchers.api_server.entry   run_server, build_async_engine_client
#   vllm.entrypoints.launchers.api_server.app_state  init_app_state
#   vllm.renderers.base                           BaseRenderer.warmup_mm  (class-scanned)
#   vllm.v1.engine.core_client                    make_client             (class-scanned)
#   uvicorn.server                                Server.startup  -> prints the report
#   vllm.v1.engine.core                           EngineCoreProc.run_engine_core, EngineCore.__init__
#   vllm.v1.worker.gpu_worker                     Worker.__init__/init_device/load_model/
#                                                 determine_available_memory/initialize_from_config/
#                                                 compile_or_warm_up_model
#   vllm.v1.worker.gpu.model_runner               GPUModelRunner.capture_model (profile|final flag)
#   vllm.model_executor.warmup.kernel_warmup      kernel_warmup, flashinfer_autotune
#
# Drift checks:
#   host, render logic only:  python3 container/patches/boot-timing/test_boot_timing.py
#   in-image, hooks fire:     see smoke one-liner in this repo's git log for this
#   directory; also visible per-boot: the report's "hooks NOT applied" note.
#
# Knobs: BOOT_TIMING=0 (launcher env) drops the mount entirely;
#        VLLM_BOOT_TIMING_DIR (container env) moves the marks file.
